  "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\">\n<meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light\">\n<title>Enquiry: Example Digital Skills Innovation Grant</title>\n<style>\n  body, table, td, a { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n  table, td { mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; }\n  a { color: #4169E1; }\n  @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {\n    .container { width: 100% !important; }\n    .px { padding-left: 20px !important; padding-right: 20px !important; }\n    .btn { display: block !important; text-align: center !important; }\n    .h1 { font-size: 22px !important; line-height: 28px !important; }\n    .label { width: 100% !important; display: block !important; padding-bottom: 0 !important; }\n    .value { width: 100% !important; display: block !important; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;\">A short enquiry from Tech2Grassroots Africa about your digital skills grant.</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" class=\"container\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:600px;max-width:100%;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E2E8F0;border-top:4px solid #4169E1;\">\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:24px 32px 8px 32px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#1E3A8A;\">Tech2Grassroots Africa</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#64748B;\">Kwara Innovation Lab (KIL)</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:16px 32px 0 32px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4169E1;font-weight:bold;\">Funding enquiry</div>\n            <h1 class=\"h1\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0 0;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:bold;color:#1E3A8A;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Enquiry: Example Digital Skills Innovation Grant</h1>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:20px 32px 0 32px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#334155;\">\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\">Dear Programme Team,</p>\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\">I am writing on behalf of Tech2Grassroots Africa to enquire about Example Digital Skills Innovation Grant, offered by Example Foundation for Digital Inclusion.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\">We are an education technology and digital skills organisation based in Nigeria, and we would like to confirm that organisations like ours are eligible to apply.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\">Could you please let us know whether there is an eligibility guide or a recommended point of contact for applicants?</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:8px 32px 0 32px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#EFF3FD;border-left:3px solid #4169E1;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding:14px 18px;\">\n                  <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:16px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1E3A8A;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:6px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Programme details</div>\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"label\" width=\"130\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#64748B;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Programme</td>\n                <td class=\"value\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:6px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#334155;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Example Digital Skills Innovation Grant</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"label\" width=\"130\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#64748B;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Funder</td>\n                <td class=\"value\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:6px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#334155;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Example Foundation for Digital Inclusion</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"label\" width=\"130\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#64748B;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Deadline</td>\n                <td class=\"value\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:6px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#334155;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">31 March 2027</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"label\" width=\"130\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:6px 12px 6px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#64748B;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Our reference</td>\n                <td class=\"value\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:6px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#334155;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">T2G-ENQ-SAMPLE-001</td>\n              </tr>\n                  </table>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:20px 32px 0 32px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#334155;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#1E3A8A;padding-bottom:4px;\">About our organisation</div>\n            <ul style=\"margin:0 0 14px 18px;padding:0;\"><li>Focus areas: digital skills, AI education and youth empowerment</li><li>Partnered with 15 schools and trained over 5,000 learners</li><li>Operates the Kwara Innovation Lab (KIL)</li></ul>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:20px 32px 0 32px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#334155;\">\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px 0;\">You can find the programme information we have referred to here:</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td bgcolor=\"#4169E1\" style=\"border-radius:4px;\">\n                  <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://example.org/grants/digital-skills\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;background-color:#4169E1;\">View programme page</a>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:24px 32px 8px 32px;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#334155;\">\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 4px 0;\">Thank you for your time and consideration.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">Kind regards,</p>\n            <!-- Shared signature partial. The renderer injects it into every template through the signature_html variable. -->\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-top:2px solid #4169E1;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#334155;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#1E3A8A;\">Sample Sender</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#64748B;\">Programmes Lead</div>\n      <div style=\"padding-top:6px;font-weight:bold;color:#334155;\">Tech2Grassroots Africa</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#64748B;\">Kwara Innovation Lab (KIL)</div>\n      <div style=\"padding-top:6px;\">\n        <a href=\"mailto:sender@example.org\" style=\"color:#4169E1;text-decoration:none;\">sender@example.org</a>\n        &nbsp;|&nbsp; +234 000 000 0000\n      </div>\n      <div><a href=\"https://example.org\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color:#4169E1;text-decoration:none;\">https://example.org</a></div>\n      <div style=\"padding-top:8px;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;color:#64748B;\">This is sample data.</div>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:12px 32px 24px 32px;border-top:1px solid #E2E8F0;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;color:#64748B;\">\n            This message was sent by Tech2Grassroots Africa. If it reached you in error, please reply and let us know so that we can update our records.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "textBody": "Tech2Grassroots Africa\n\n Kwara Innovation Lab (KIL)\n\n Funding enquiry\n\n Enquiry: Example Digital Skills Innovation Grant\n\n Dear Programme Team,\n\n I am writing on behalf of Tech2Grassroots Africa to enquire about Example Digital Skills Innovation Grant, offered by Example Foundation for Digital Inclusion.\n\n We are an education technology and digital skills organisation based in Nigeria, and we would like to confirm that organisations like ours are eligible to apply.\nCould you please let us know whether there is an eligibility guide or a recommended point of contact for applicants?\n\n Programme details\n\n Programme\n Example Digital Skills Innovation Grant\n\n Funder\n Example Foundation for Digital Inclusion\n\n Deadline\n 31 March 2027\n\n Our reference\n T2G-ENQ-SAMPLE-001\n\n About our organisation\n\n Focus areas: digital skills, AI education and youth empowerment\nPartnered with 15 schools and trained over 5,000 learners\nOperates the Kwara Innovation Lab (KIL)\n\n You can find the programme information we have referred to here:\n\n View programme page (https://example.org/grants/digital-skills)\n\n Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\n Kind regards,\n\n Sample Sender\n\n Programmes Lead\n\n Tech2Grassroots Africa\n\n Kwara Innovation Lab (KIL)\n\n sender@example.org (mailto:sender@example.org)\n | +234 000 000 0000\n\n https://example.org\n\n This is sample data.\n\n This message was sent by Tech2Grassroots Africa. If it reached you in error, please reply and let us know so that we can update our records.",
